WEBVTT

00:00:06.630 --> 00:00:08.850
Let's go, Hou-nee.

00:00:08.850 --> 00:00:10.010
Bring it on.

00:00:13.750 --> 00:00:16.530
Fuu Houhou, die!

00:00:16.530 --> 00:00:21.680
Chou Soran, I will take your life!

00:00:27.550 --> 00:00:29.800
Oh, no!

00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:32.990
Wow, Chou Soran is amazing.

00:00:32.990 --> 00:00:35.580
I lost. Ugh...

00:00:37.010 --> 00:00:39.180
Chou Soran versus Fuu Houhou!

00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:42.630
Chou Soran wins!

00:00:42.630 --> 00:00:47.360
How could we keep our mouths 
shut after that farce?

00:00:47.360 --> 00:00:50.310
You're shameless!

00:00:53.300 --> 00:00:56.610
I can't believe they saw 
through our brilliant acting.

00:00:56.610 --> 00:00:58.530
How was that brilliant?

00:00:58.530 --> 00:01:01.580
Damn it! You ruined my amazing performance!

00:01:02.100 --> 00:01:03.730
It's over.

00:01:03.730 --> 00:01:07.150
Our company's image is ruined...

00:01:08.070 --> 00:01:12.770
Our image wasn't that good to begin with.

00:01:12.770 --> 00:01:14.200
Anyway...

00:01:14.750 --> 00:01:19.360
I can't believe Soran actually 
made it to the finals.

00:01:29.900 --> 00:01:33.480
<i>The months that pass within my dreams</i>

00:01:33.780 --> 00:01:37.400
<i>I cast aside my worldly desires 
along with my black hair</i>

00:01:37.700 --> 00:01:43.660
<i>If I turn around, the stories of the 
past would appear before my eyes</i>

00:01:45.410 --> 00:01:49.120
<i>In a drunken haze, I laugh at the world</i>

00:01:49.460 --> 00:01:53.000
<i>Shangri-la is nowhere to be found</i>

00:01:53.210 --> 00:01:58.800
<i>No one knows the love of the spring wind</i>

00:02:00.970 --> 00:02:08.020
<i>The beginning and the 
end repeat over and over</i>

00:02:08.600 --> 00:02:15.990
<i>Trading places, they bloom then wilt</i>

00:02:16.440 --> 00:02:19.820
<i>In January, I pick a flower with no petals</i>

00:02:20.280 --> 00:02:27.160
<i>In February, I pick a flower 
that just started blooming</i>

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:31.670
<i>In March, the peach blossoms bloom</i>

00:02:31.830 --> 00:02:38.630
<i>In April, the wisteria are in 
full bloom above the trellis</i>

00:02:39.130 --> 00:02:42.680
<i>In February, I pick a flower 
that just started blooming</i>

00:02:42.970 --> 00:02:46.770
<i>In April, the wisteria are in 
full bloom above the trellis</i>

00:02:50.480 --> 00:02:56.780
<b>14: Suizourai</b>

00:03:01.210 --> 00:03:02.870
It's freezing...

00:03:01.820 --> 00:03:15.540
<b><i>Hitorinoshita -The Outcast</i> comic is now being published in Shonen JUMP+!</b>

00:03:03.380 --> 00:03:06.660
But they shouldn't find us up here.

00:03:08.170 --> 00:03:11.440
There was no reason for 
them to get that mad.

00:03:11.440 --> 00:03:12.730
Chou Soran.

00:03:14.400 --> 00:03:17.770
You have to win tomorrow's match.

00:03:20.590 --> 00:03:21.860
Hou-nee.

00:03:22.660 --> 00:03:26.150
We haven't known each other that long...

00:03:31.280 --> 00:03:36.940
But I never thought I'd hear that from you.

00:03:37.900 --> 00:03:39.800
Did something happen?

00:03:40.930 --> 00:03:41.940
Yeah...

00:03:46.430 --> 00:03:51.370
I don't know what I should do anymore.

00:03:51.900 --> 00:03:55.720
It's like, uh... it's...

00:03:55.720 --> 00:03:59.220
Uh... well...

00:04:00.480 --> 00:04:02.420
I can't put it into words.

00:04:03.370 --> 00:04:05.770
You mean you don't belong anywhere.

00:04:07.280 --> 00:04:08.060
Yeah.

00:04:08.470 --> 00:04:09.720
That's it.

00:04:10.310 --> 00:04:14.000
I thought so hard, but couldn't 
come up with the words.

00:04:14.000 --> 00:04:15.440
You're amazing.

00:04:16.200 --> 00:04:19.430
That's right. Everyone's amazing.

00:04:19.430 --> 00:04:23.300
I don't have a place where I belong,
but everyone else does.

00:04:23.900 --> 00:04:25.780
Jo San and Jo Yon,

00:04:25.780 --> 00:04:30.410
the strange white-haired lady who always 
picks fights with me, the weird monk...

00:04:30.410 --> 00:04:34.760
Everyone I've met is more amazing than me.

00:04:35.310 --> 00:04:37.740
They know what they should do

00:04:38.130 --> 00:04:40.500
and where they should go.

00:04:41.700 --> 00:04:43.950
And where to return to.

00:04:53.790 --> 00:04:57.960
Dad, I will avenge Shinton.

00:04:57.960 --> 00:04:58.680
Saen.

00:05:00.480 --> 00:05:01.740
Let it go.

00:05:02.300 --> 00:05:04.310
Your battle is over.

00:05:04.870 --> 00:05:06.280
Good work.

00:05:06.750 --> 00:05:08.400
You should rest.

00:05:17.080 --> 00:05:19.950
Is your brother okay?

00:05:21.770 --> 00:05:23.100
Saen-san?

00:05:28.160 --> 00:05:29.130
Hey!

00:05:29.130 --> 00:05:31.180
What's up with you?

00:05:31.180 --> 00:05:32.590
Where are we going?

00:05:32.590 --> 00:05:34.110
Come with me.

00:05:33.320 --> 00:05:34.340
Hey!

00:05:37.490 --> 00:05:39.280
I brought you some water.

00:05:38.450 --> 00:05:40.010
Damn it!

00:05:40.010 --> 00:05:41.640
I'm sorry!

00:05:41.640 --> 00:05:45.370
What's with the Fuu family's Kourei Kenshou?

00:05:45.370 --> 00:05:48.270
We're powerless against it!

00:05:48.270 --> 00:05:49.600
Damn it!

00:05:49.600 --> 00:05:52.490
Perhaps we should speak to Grandmother.

00:05:52.490 --> 00:05:53.950
Huh? Grandma?

00:05:53.950 --> 00:05:58.190
She stayed away from this Raten Taishou.

00:05:58.190 --> 00:06:00.720
She's stayed inside her 
house this entire time.

00:06:01.290 --> 00:06:03.000
Now that I think about it,

00:06:03.000 --> 00:06:08.810
she stopped making public appearances 
after Fuu Chonhao became an Elder,

00:06:09.310 --> 00:06:12.250
as though she's resigned 
from the Ten Elders.

00:06:13.230 --> 00:06:16.330
She must know something.

00:06:18.370 --> 00:06:22.390
Yes, ma'am. It was worth coming here.

00:06:22.830 --> 00:06:27.020
We should definitely keep 
an eye on Fuu Houhou.

00:06:27.400 --> 00:06:32.690
We gained a lot of information 
from speaking directly to her

00:06:32.690 --> 00:06:35.580
and the other members of the 
Express Delivery Company.

00:06:35.580 --> 00:06:39.600
We were even able to collect one 
of her hairs after her match.

00:06:41.230 --> 00:06:46.550
But where did you get your 
information on Fuu Houhou, ma'am?

00:06:48.710 --> 00:06:51.110
I can't tell you yet.

00:06:51.110 --> 00:06:56.690
All you need to do is keep 
your mouths shut and obey me.

00:06:58.970 --> 00:07:01.840
Yeah. Sorry, Grandmaster.

00:07:01.840 --> 00:07:04.680
I used my Fuukou Qimen during a match.

00:07:05.330 --> 00:07:07.360
I was up against a strong opponent.

00:07:07.360 --> 00:07:09.740
He would've beaten me if I hadn't used it.

00:07:10.580 --> 00:07:12.440
This must be fate.

00:07:12.960 --> 00:07:16.730
But I was able to defend the Tenshi's honor.

00:07:17.860 --> 00:07:22.460
Yeah. I am sorry for the 
trouble I caused Butousan.

00:07:30.960 --> 00:07:32.350
Ouya-dono.

00:07:35.000 --> 00:07:38.310
Ah, you're leaving already?

00:07:38.310 --> 00:07:39.320
Yeah.

00:07:39.320 --> 00:07:44.080
Haku-chan, try to work on your 
courage once you get home, okay?

00:07:44.080 --> 00:07:47.160
So you won't wimp out if 
you fight someone scary.

00:07:47.160 --> 00:07:50.040
Shut up! Nothing scares me!

00:07:50.970 --> 00:07:53.500
Ouya-dono, you're leaving today, aren't you?

00:07:53.500 --> 00:07:56.500
Why don't you come with us to the airport?

00:07:56.500 --> 00:08:00.700
I wish I could, but I'm 
taking the train home.

00:08:00.700 --> 00:08:03.140
I'm flat broke right now.

00:08:04.810 --> 00:08:06.430
That's too bad.

00:08:06.430 --> 00:08:09.880
There's so much I wanted 
to ask you on the way.

00:08:10.250 --> 00:08:12.960
In that case, we'll be leaving now.

00:08:12.960 --> 00:08:14.590
Sure. Take care.

00:08:16.420 --> 00:08:18.170
Oh, yes. Ouya-dono...

00:08:18.640 --> 00:08:21.270
I had something to tell you.

00:08:22.240 --> 00:08:27.850
You gave Chou Soran a choice, 
and he made his decision.

00:08:27.850 --> 00:08:35.060
Wasn't coming here to Ryuukosan and 
offering him a choice your own decision?

00:08:35.060 --> 00:08:39.360
You used a spell to eavesdrop on me!

00:08:39.980 --> 00:08:44.470
It was your decision. There's 
no point in regretting it now.

00:08:44.470 --> 00:08:46.880
Try not to worry about it too much.

00:08:46.880 --> 00:08:48.870
Mind your own business!

00:08:48.870 --> 00:08:52.880
I don't enjoy getting involved
in complicated matters,

00:08:52.880 --> 00:08:56.210
but if you're ever in trouble, I'll help.

00:08:56.610 --> 00:09:02.020
I wouldn't go so far as to risk my 
life for you, but I'll do what I can.

00:09:03.020 --> 00:09:05.890
Hah! Who would ever ask for your help?

00:09:05.890 --> 00:09:10.550
I wanted to be a mysterious character, 
but I can't keep any secrets with you around!

00:09:12.600 --> 00:09:15.090
I'll visit Butousan sometime soon.

00:09:15.090 --> 00:09:16.100
Screw you.

00:09:17.290 --> 00:09:19.320
What a strange guy.

00:09:27.830 --> 00:09:30.070
<i>Butousan, huh?</i>

00:09:37.640 --> 00:09:41.790
Grandmaster, Master, everyone at Butousan...

00:09:42.370 --> 00:09:44.290
Thank you for everything.

00:09:47.370 --> 00:09:48.930
Like that bird,

00:09:50.150 --> 00:09:56.010
if I knew where I came from, 
I'd know where I should go.

00:09:56.580 --> 00:09:58.690
You want someplace to return to?

00:09:59.350 --> 00:10:04.360
You're amazing. You know 
everything I'm thinking.

00:10:06.600 --> 00:10:08.660
Of course I do.

00:10:09.920 --> 00:10:13.120
I don't have anywhere to return to, either.

00:10:15.000 --> 00:10:16.580
Come, Reigyoku.

00:10:16.580 --> 00:10:20.200
You should eat a proper breakfast 
to prepare for the finals.

00:10:20.200 --> 00:10:22.010
Yes, Master.

00:10:26.870 --> 00:10:28.260
Reigyoku.

00:10:28.810 --> 00:10:34.100
I dragged a lot of people into 
this for Chou Soran's sake.

00:10:34.100 --> 00:10:36.390
Are you not going to reprimand me?

00:10:36.390 --> 00:10:37.510
Of course not.

00:10:37.510 --> 00:10:40.740
I would never reprimand you, Master.

00:10:41.190 --> 00:10:46.220
You wouldn't? Or you can't?

00:10:46.940 --> 00:10:50.210
I want to know how you really feel.

00:10:54.970 --> 00:11:00.040
Master, it's true that 
I owe you a great deal,

00:11:00.040 --> 00:11:05.610
but it's not the only reason I respect you.

00:11:06.010 --> 00:11:09.230
Your behavior, your discipline, your spirit...

00:11:09.800 --> 00:11:16.120
In all regards, you are a master 
worth devoting my life to.

00:11:16.810 --> 00:11:21.990
If there's something you can't 
tell me, there must be a reason.

00:11:22.550 --> 00:11:25.910
I would never reprimand you.

00:11:28.900 --> 00:11:30.940
Not even if I do this?

00:11:30.940 --> 00:11:32.660
Uh, I...

00:11:33.450 --> 00:11:40.340
You certainly are perfect and without 
flaws, but you're a tad too serious.

00:11:40.340 --> 00:11:41.840
But no matter.

00:11:41.840 --> 00:11:45.510
After hearing that, I'm relieved.

00:11:46.280 --> 00:11:52.060
Why don't I give you a bit 
of advice before your match?

00:11:52.430 --> 00:11:53.820
Listen closely.

00:11:53.820 --> 00:11:57.670
Go beat the stuffing out of Chou Soran.

00:11:57.670 --> 00:12:00.100
Don't worry about me.

00:12:02.010 --> 00:12:03.800
Master! Reigyoku!

00:12:07.260 --> 00:12:11.500
Good morning, Master! Reigyoku-sama!

00:12:12.120 --> 00:12:13.210
Yes.

00:12:13.860 --> 00:12:18.000
Master, there's something we'd like 
to discuss with Reigyoku-sama.

00:12:18.000 --> 00:12:19.500
Would that be all right?

00:12:19.880 --> 00:12:22.360
Sure. Do what you want.

00:12:22.360 --> 00:12:24.440
What is it, Senpai?

00:12:24.960 --> 00:12:27.000
Just come with me.

00:12:28.080 --> 00:12:31.060
What did you want to discuss?

00:12:32.440 --> 00:12:33.650
You...

00:12:34.010 --> 00:12:37.550
lose to Chou Soran, and you'll regret it.

00:12:37.550 --> 00:12:38.820
Uh, okay...

00:12:38.820 --> 00:12:40.340
Don't give me that!

00:12:40.340 --> 00:12:44.700
If that shameless boy claims the Tenshi's 
seat, the Tenshifu will be done for!

00:12:47.110 --> 00:12:48.780
Listen, Reigyoku.

00:12:48.780 --> 00:12:51.820
If you lose, I'm leaving Ryuukosan.

00:12:51.820 --> 00:12:54.500
You'll have to look after the Tenshi.

00:12:54.500 --> 00:12:56.290
Defeat Chou Soran!

00:12:55.290 --> 00:12:57.500
Fight like your life depends on it.

00:12:56.290 --> 00:12:58.570
Chou Reigyoku must win!

00:12:58.960 --> 00:13:00.790
Defeat Chou Soran!

00:13:00.790 --> 00:13:02.840
Chou Reigyoku must win!

00:13:03.480 --> 00:13:05.560
Defeat Chou Soran!

00:13:05.560 --> 00:13:07.600
Chou Reigyoku must win!

00:13:33.730 --> 00:13:36.150
It's the final match of the Raten Taishou!

00:13:36.150 --> 00:13:39.000
Chou Reigyoku versus Chou Soran!

00:13:39.720 --> 00:13:40.800
It's nearly time.

00:13:40.800 --> 00:13:42.160
It's Reigyoku-sama.

00:13:42.160 --> 00:13:43.170
We're counting on you!

00:13:43.170 --> 00:13:44.250
Reigyoku-sama!

00:13:44.250 --> 00:13:46.030
You've got this, Reigyoku-sama!

00:13:46.630 --> 00:13:48.410
Knock Chou Soran out!

00:13:54.680 --> 00:13:55.510
Get him!

00:13:58.760 --> 00:14:01.430
The finals will now begin!

00:14:05.400 --> 00:14:07.200
Tenchi Genshou...

00:14:07.620 --> 00:14:09.490
Tenchi Genshou...

00:14:09.730 --> 00:14:11.380
Banki Kongen...

00:14:11.380 --> 00:14:15.280
Bring order to disaster, 
and reveal my divine power.

00:14:15.680 --> 00:14:17.480
Sangai Naigai...

00:14:17.480 --> 00:14:19.180
Yuidou Dokuson...

00:14:19.180 --> 00:14:20.730
Tainai Kinkou...

00:14:21.120 --> 00:14:22.960
Protect me.

00:14:40.470 --> 00:14:42.780
<i>Chou Soran fights well.</i>

00:14:43.550 --> 00:14:48.050
<i>Chou Soran's Kinkouju is clearly 
inferior to Reigyoku's.</i>

00:14:48.610 --> 00:14:50.190
<i>Regardless,</i>

00:14:50.640 --> 00:14:55.830
<i>by focusing his kinkou at a single point 
at the moment he attacks or defends,</i>

00:14:55.830 --> 00:14:59.840
<i>he increases its effectiveness 
and fights as his equal.</i>

00:15:00.530 --> 00:15:03.620
<i>However, it's still an unorthodox technique.</i>

00:15:08.000 --> 00:15:10.020
<i>His blows are so heavy.</i>

00:15:10.020 --> 00:15:11.740
<i>At this rate, he'll beat me.</i>

00:15:23.140 --> 00:15:26.410
Chou Soran, in just one month,

00:15:26.410 --> 00:15:30.740
you've grown strong enough to stay on your 
feet after taking a blow from my Kinkouju.

00:15:31.070 --> 00:15:35.280
You move like a different person, too.

00:15:35.280 --> 00:15:38.770
Perhaps you really do have talent.

00:15:39.810 --> 00:15:41.360
Of course I do.

00:15:41.880 --> 00:15:45.000
Reigyoku-sama, you're definitely strong.

00:15:45.000 --> 00:15:52.090
But the one who helped me train 
this past month was even stronger.

00:15:53.770 --> 00:15:57.070
You certainly have made advancements 
in your fighting technique.

00:15:57.850 --> 00:16:01.490
I'll test this next.

00:16:01.940 --> 00:16:05.100
Let's see how much your Raihou has improved.

00:16:07.480 --> 00:16:09.150
Ingoraihou!

00:16:09.150 --> 00:16:10.680
Yougoraihou!

00:16:11.110 --> 00:16:12.200
<b>Shoushinrai</b>

00:16:11.110 --> 00:16:12.390
Shoushinrai!

00:16:33.890 --> 00:16:37.710
<i>I can't believe he's grown so much 
in such a short amount of time.</i>

00:16:38.380 --> 00:16:41.930
<i>It's no wonder he caught my master's eye.</i>

00:16:44.000 --> 00:16:45.520
Yougorai...

00:16:45.520 --> 00:16:48.980
I still love this light.

00:16:48.980 --> 00:16:52.510
That bold, open glow...

00:16:53.010 --> 00:16:59.240
It gives off a perfectly clear 
and bright, lively light.

00:16:59.240 --> 00:17:01.310
That is Yougorai.

00:17:01.780 --> 00:17:06.390
Is Reigyoku still hung up on Yougorai?

00:17:06.390 --> 00:17:07.370
Yes.

00:17:08.020 --> 00:17:13.330
He still hasn't been able 
to overcome that wall.

00:17:13.330 --> 00:17:18.420
He stubbornly refuses to use his 
Ingorai in the presence of others.

00:17:18.970 --> 00:17:23.680
No matter how difficult the battle, 
he tries to win using only Shoushinrai.

00:17:24.130 --> 00:17:28.800
However, Shoushinrai is 
a positive technique.

00:17:29.320 --> 00:17:33.900
As much as he admires the bold, 
open light of the positive,

00:17:33.900 --> 00:17:36.860
the negative is the negative.

00:17:40.620 --> 00:17:42.370
<b>Raihou</b>

00:17:40.940 --> 00:17:42.580
Raihou.

00:17:42.370 --> 00:17:51.550
<b>Gorai Seihou</b>

00:17:42.580 --> 00:17:45.310
Also known as Gorai Seihou.

00:17:45.850 --> 00:17:51.680
It's written as "five thunders," 
but it's actually "the five ki."

00:17:53.270 --> 00:17:59.090
People are born with ki in their bodies.

00:17:59.090 --> 00:18:02.880
That ki can be divided into five types...

00:18:03.290 --> 00:18:05.790
Shinki, which governs fire.

00:18:03.390 --> 00:18:18.160
<b>Shinki</b>

00:18:05.790 --> 00:18:08.390
Haiki, which governs metal.

00:18:06.020 --> 00:18:18.160
<b>Haiki</b>

00:18:08.390 --> 00:18:11.250
Jinki, which governs water.

00:18:09.020 --> 00:18:18.160
<b>Jinki</b>

00:18:11.190 --> 00:18:18.160
<b>Kanki</b>

00:18:11.250 --> 00:18:14.060
Kanki, which governs wood.

00:18:14.060 --> 00:18:17.910
And Hiki, which governs earth.

00:18:15.610 --> 00:18:18.160
<b>Hiki</b>

00:18:18.860 --> 00:18:25.840
The technique of combining the five ki 
into one and releasing it is Gorai Seihou.

00:18:26.740 --> 00:18:32.540
And in the case of untainted, 
pure individuals, it is filled with life.

00:18:32.540 --> 00:18:36.510
<b>Hiki</b>

00:18:32.540 --> 00:18:36.550
<b>Kanki</b>

00:18:32.540 --> 00:18:36.590
<b>Jinki</b>

00:18:32.540 --> 00:18:38.260
<b>Shinki</b>

00:18:32.540 --> 00:18:38.300
<b>Haiki</b>

00:18:33.030 --> 00:18:39.350
Among the five types of ki, shinki 
guides haiki, releasing positive ki.

00:18:37.050 --> 00:18:39.340
<b>Life</b>

00:18:39.700 --> 00:18:41.530
This is Yougorai.

00:18:41.530 --> 00:18:48.780
Meanwhile, those who have become impure 
lose their ki, which can't be regained.

00:18:48.780 --> 00:18:52.550
It makes learning Raihou 
incredibly difficult.

00:18:52.550 --> 00:18:55.200
Through trial and error, 
our ancestors learned

00:18:55.200 --> 00:18:57.960
to use jinki, the polar 
opposite of positive ki,

00:18:57.960 --> 00:19:02.480
to guide kanki, creating a Raihou 
that releases negative ki.

00:19:03.220 --> 00:19:05.410
This is Ingorai.

00:19:13.670 --> 00:19:15.530
What is that?

00:19:15.530 --> 00:19:18.430
Is that Raihou?

00:19:18.430 --> 00:19:20.390
It's kinda creepy.

00:19:20.750 --> 00:19:27.260
Though it looks like mud, once you learn 
to use it, it's as flexible as mercury.

00:19:27.970 --> 00:19:32.410
This is the true form of Ingorai.

00:19:36.260 --> 00:19:41.200
Does it hurt you to show your 
Ingorai in public, Reigyoku?

00:19:42.230 --> 00:19:46.740
But that is the true you.

00:19:47.920 --> 00:19:53.570
Accept your unsightly appearance 
and fight without shame.

00:20:23.650 --> 00:20:25.900
<i>This is the true Ingorai.</i>

00:20:26.180 --> 00:20:28.410
<i>Touching it would definitely be bad.</i>

00:20:28.410 --> 00:20:29.460
<i>Damn.</i>

00:20:29.460 --> 00:20:32.170
<i>It's all over the place. 
There's nowhere to run.</i>

00:20:33.000 --> 00:20:34.450
Hokkyou Souen!

00:20:41.500 --> 00:20:43.230
Kinkou Goshin!

00:20:48.430 --> 00:20:50.310
<i>I feel weak...</i>

00:20:51.500 --> 00:20:53.900
<i>Is it because I touched this black ki?</i>

00:20:53.900 --> 00:20:56.320
<i>I can't believe my Kinkouju can't stop it.</i>

00:20:59.690 --> 00:21:01.070
Shoushinrai!

00:21:16.710 --> 00:21:19.600
Looks like you avoided a direct 
blow by using Shoushinrai.

00:21:19.880 --> 00:21:21.020
However...

00:21:22.260 --> 00:21:28.190
Those who touch this Ingorai have 
their bones broken, hearts tainted,

00:21:28.190 --> 00:21:32.420
and spirits destroyed.

00:21:33.230 --> 00:21:38.110
Chou Soran, this is the true Ingorai:

00:21:38.720 --> 00:21:40.770
Suizourai.

00:23:22.960 --> 00:23:24.210
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:23.070 --> 00:23:26.380
Sei-nii, don't you feel like 
we're forgetting something?

00:23:26.380 --> 00:23:28.930
I do feel like we shouldn't leave yet.

00:23:28.930 --> 00:23:31.020
I feel like we're overlooking something...

00:23:31.020 --> 00:23:33.570
My final match against Reigyoku-sama!

00:23:33.570 --> 00:23:35.170
We forgot!

00:23:35.170 --> 00:23:37.680
Next time on <i>Hitorinoshita - 
The Outcast</i>, "Dauntless."

00:23:37.680 --> 00:23:39.130
Don't miss it.

00:23:37.680 --> 00:23:39.980
<b>15: Dauntless</b>
